{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/revcontentsdk\/scrollcontextplacement"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/revcontentsdk\/scrollcontextplacement"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"RevcontentAdView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reports widget visibility back to the underlying widget JavaScript so impressions, viewability, and intersection events fire correctly. To do that, the SDK needs a reference to the enclosing ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/SwiftUICore\/View\/revcontentScrollContext()","type":"reference"},{"text":" modifier walks the view hierarchy at attach time to find that scroll view. It must be applied to a view that is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"inside"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the ","type":"text"},{"code":"ScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s content — not to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"ScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" itself, where it would walk the hierarchy ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"above"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the scroll view and miss it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Misplace the modifier and the SDK’s DEBUG assertions will fire immediately during development. In release, the SDK falls back to a warning and impression data will be missing or inaccurate.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Right way","anchor":"Right-way"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Apply the modifier to a view inside the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScrollView"},{"text":"’s content:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["ScrollView {","    VStack {","        ArticleBody()","        RevcontentAdView(widgetId: \"abc-123\")","    }","    .revcontentScrollContext()","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The modifier is on the "},{"code":"VStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which is inside the "},{"code":"ScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The finder walks up from the "},{"code":"VStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and discovers the enclosing "},{"code":"UIScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Wrong way","anchor":"Wrong-way"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not apply the modifier to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScrollView"},{"type":"text","text":" itself:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ WRONG — finder walks above the ScrollView and finds nothing","ScrollView {","    VStack {","        ArticleBody()","        RevcontentAdView(widgetId: \"abc-123\")","    }","}",".revcontentScrollContext()"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Also wrong: forgetting the modifier entirely. The SDK provides a default empty scroll context as a fallback, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevcontentAdView"},{"type":"text","text":" will still render — but no scroll-driven events will fire, and DEBUG builds will assert."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Why this design","anchor":"Why-this-design"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI doesn’t expose the underlying "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIScrollView"},{"type":"text","text":" directly. The modifier installs a tiny invisible "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIView"},{"type":"text","text":" as a background, then walks up the superview chain at window-attachment time to locate the scroll view. Apply it inside the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScrollView"},{"type":"text","text":"’s content for that walk to succeed."}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/ScrollContextPlacement","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Articles","title":"Articles","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/ThemeIntegration","doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/UIKitAndObjectiveC","doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/JSEventContract"]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Related-modifiers","title":"Related modifiers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/SwiftUICore\/View\/revcontentScrollContext()","doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/RevcontentAdView"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Apply "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revcontentScrollContext()"},{"type":"text","text":" inside the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScrollView"},{"type":"text","text":"’s content, not on the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScrollView"},{"type":"text","text":" itself."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"RevcontentSDK"}],"role":"collectionGroup","roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"Scroll context placement"},"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK"]]},"references":{"doc://com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK/documentation/RevcontentSDK/RevcontentAdView":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A SwiftUI view that displays a Revcontent ad widget."}],"type":"topic","title":"RevcontentAdView","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RevcontentAdView","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/RevcontentAdView","url":"\/documentation\/revcontentsdk\/revcontentadview","kind":"symbol"